  m_Name: DoorDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueAsset
  dialogue:
  - "\u201CWhy won\u2019t it open?\u201D"
  - "I go to open the door, but the handle doesn\u2019t work. "
  - Someone will probably come to help eventually. All I have to do is wait.
  - '*Knock Knock*'
  - The sound makes me flinch and take a step back
  - '<i>Are you home? I need your assistance</i>

'
  - "<i>It\u2019s the Janitor, I left the key to my closet in your apartment.</i>"
